  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">United on the road to justice: documentation of serious international crimes during the Russian armed aggression in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ensuring effective work and coordination of efforts of member organizations of the Ukraine. 5AM Coalition regarding the documentation of war crimes and crimes against humanity, the dissemination of information about the most serious crimes committed during the Russian armed aggression, the development and advocacy of an effective mechanism of justice in conditions of war.  the field of documenting war crimes and crimes against humanity. The project is aimed at strengthening the Coalition&#x2019;s capacity in the spheres: - documenting war crimes and crimes against humanity to ensure the inevitability of punishing criminals, - preserving evidence of war crimes and crimes against humanity in accordance with international standards, - informing the general public about the most serious international crimes in Ukraine, - developing expert proposals on the architecture of justice and approaches to helping victims</narrative>
  </description>
